    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whacked! is an action-packed top-down 2D/3D online PvP shooter. You and up to three friends can battle it out, round by round, to see who deserves a spot beside the big boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizing your gangster plays a huge factor when trying to impress your superiors. Choose an animal of your liking, alter the color and pattern of your suit, and get ready for chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, players fight on a new map that is chosen at random. All maps contain different weapon spawns, destructible elements, and unique layouts. The boss will reward his henchmen periodically to remind them who's in charge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be the last one standing?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whacked! is an action-packed top-down 2D/3D online PvP shooter. You and up to three friends can battle it out, round by round, to see who deserves a spot beside the big boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizing your gangster plays a huge factor when trying to impress your superiors. Choose an animal of your liking, alter the color and pattern of your suit, and get ready for chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, players fight on a new map that is chosen at random. All maps contain different weapon spawns, destructible elements, and unique layouts. The boss will reward his henchmen periodically to remind them who's in charge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be the last one standing?</p>",
    "short_description": "The big boss is looking for a new right-hand henchman, so it\u2019s your time to shine! Choose a gangster, put on your most stylish suit, and WHACK your friends in this fast-paced, action-packed, top-down PvP shooter! Dive and shoot your way through destructible maps while trying to not get WHACKED!",
